# hub_entry authoring plan (re-recorded on the drive model): the menu prefix anchored on the GameController states (the drive model moves
# the loads): title (7) -> START -> main menu (8) -> NEW GAME -> create the save file -> slot 1 -> the hub, Playing (12) ->
# the "auto-save on" notice dismissed. Records as fixtures/padlogs/hub_entry.padlog (--stop-at 4910: Playing 2629 + 2281,
# the old 4200's offset from its Playing 1919).
until-gstate 7 3000
idle 11
hold START 5
until-gstate 8 300
idle 128
hold CROSS 5
idle 295
hold UP 3
idle 97
hold CROSS 3
idle 247
hold DOWN 3
idle 67
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 12 2000
idle 151
hold CROSS 3
stop
